{"uid":"cd9251c0635bd7e6","name":"test_log_endpoint_falls_back_to_on_disk_merge_for_a_dead_run","fullName":"tests.test_cli_ui#test_log_endpoint_falls_back_to_on_disk_merge_for_a_dead_run","historyId":"265cf977f68e66862cbf399c638eee2f","time":{"start":1791867218721,"stop":1791867219138,"duration":417},"description":"Task 039 (#6): the hub's log tail used to be live-only -- an\n    unreachable run (container died, or simply finished) answered\n    `{live: false, lines: []}`, so the operator investigating a dead run in\n    the hub saw an empty box even though the transcript was sitting on disk\n    in `iterations/*/output.jsonl`. Now the endpoint falls back to\n    `log_merge.merged_lines` (the SAME merge the engine serves from inside\n    the container, task 038) and only `live` goes false.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 039 (#6): the hub's log tail used to be live-only -- an<br />\nunreachable run (container died, or simply finished) answered<br />\n<code>{live: false, lines: []}</code>, so the operator investigating a dead run in<br />\nthe hub saw an empty box even though the transcript was sitting on disk<br />\nin <code>iterations/*/output.jsonl</code>. Now the endpoint falls back to<br />\n<code>log_merge.merged_lines</code> (the SAME merge the engine serves from inside<br />\nthe container, task 038) and only <code>live</code> goes false.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791866910559,"stop":1791866910559,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791866910560,"stop":1791866910560,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,